QuestionID":"QID126"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1BS1hBCYWqTVFgG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID127","SecondaryAttribute":"- \u017einut\u0117s, kurios kalba apie gr\u0117smes m\u016bs\u0173 kult\u016brai, tapatybei ar \u0161alies i\u0161likimui, paprastai","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><\/p>\n\n<p><b>- \u017einut\u0117s, kurios kalba apie gr\u0117smes m\u016bs\u0173 kult\u016brai, tapatybei ar \u0161alies i\u0161likimui, paprastai jums nesukelia stipri\u0173 emocij\u0173. <\/b><br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n<i>Tokios emocin\u0117s reakcijos paprastai siejamos su geb\u0117jimu atskirti tikras visuomen\u0117s problemas nuo pasakojim\u0173, kurie dirbtinai i\u0161pu\u010dia gr\u0117smes, siekiant sukelti baim\u0119 ar pykt\u012f. Toks reagavimo pob\u016bdis da\u017eniausiai siejamas su didesniu atsparumu klaidinan\u010diai informacijai, kuria prie\u0161i\u0161kos u\u017esienio \u0161alys perd\u0117tai i\u0161ry\u0161kina gr\u0117smes. <\/i>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"threat low","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"- \u017einut\u0117s, kurios kalba apie gr\u0117smes m\u016bs\u0173 kult\u016brai, tapatybei ar \u0161alies i\u0161likimui, paprastai jums...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID127","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is unloaded*\/\n\n});","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">group_threat<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Equal to<\/span> <span class=\"RightOpDesc\"> bottom <\/span>","LeftOperand":"group_threat","LogicType":"E